// The sketch hashes every token in the norm.
// Ordinary program: no HOLD_FLASH line.

CUBE sketch ROLE observer PROTON 1
CUBE rank   ROLE nanobot  PROTON 1

PLUG sketch rank

IMPULSE sketch 1
IMPULSE rank 1
ENERGYFLOW 1
FLOW 1
HARMONY rank
DECIDE rank
ASSERT CUBES >= 2
PRINT "sketch" UNITY DECIDE ENERGY
